Cell["\<\
Check consistency on the second polynomial. Should be related to a certain \
square of the first polynomial subtracted by the expression inside the square \
root:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9566288237603025`*^9, 3.956628829876834*^9}, {
  3.9594773836911154`*^9, 3.959477391575383*^9}, {3.9705547384550533`*^9, 
