Cell["\<\
Note that this is the canonical form for the free theory of a massive spin-2 \
field plus that of a massless spin-2 field.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9472324531685147`*^9, 
  3.9472324789547677`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5390df32-be30-4d60-ae7b-\
8c013ee2d08b"],

